{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c72b7aef1dbc92bb6189b9de7e7f012c4e74ca3315124ce4a1900a39368f3b52", "ja": "紬、それに歌織さん、お疲れさまです。\n今、『アイフェス』の話をしていませんでした？", "zh": "紬，还有歌织，辛苦了。你们刚才是在聊“偶像祭”的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1001_052kao", "source_sha256": "69e26c2bdf1728f4b32296ce17085ec61d0006b525e7440d0b4bf7fc83621608", "ja": "あら、お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\nそうなんですよ。楽しみね、って。", "zh": "哎呀，您辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n是啊，我们正聊着真让人期待呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ac21cd08a4a8da8129aa1d7c1e7cae9a07fa748e0d2f48aa66aeb3ab6cd3729d", "ja": "39プロジェクト全員で参加する、大きなイベント……\nまたご招待いただけるとは、光栄なことです。", "zh": "39 Project全员一同参加的大型活动……\n能再次受到邀请，真是太荣幸了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bd9c37f23bd37df329a1b24a3a58d0240e4dd11eaa2a441e70ef9c970dae508c", "ja": "貴方の方の準備は大丈夫なのですか？　全体練習では\nお見掛けしませんでしたが、まさか……忘れて？", "zh": "您那边的准备没问题吗？全体练习时我没看到您，难道……您忘了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9a027d4707e100c967616420b2182088062bc53058e2baefbe60e54c0ad91cc6", "ja": "いやいや、その『アイフェス』の打ち合わせが\n忙しいんだよ。実は、ちょっとした考えがあって。", "zh": "不不，我忙着开那个“爱祭”的碰头会呢。\n其实，我心里有个小小的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4f4e96a3cfa940bac0aa5954b65eaf1a2a52d9c9fcb6c0b3e878333caf3e94d7", "ja": "……ちょっとしか考えていないのですか？", "zh": "……您就只想了“一点点”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1006_p", "source_sha256": "05cf992cf9ae02dde4aad090b2e7608f60d6da9b7a910e16c33d3daa3c4d15c4", "ja": "いやすごく考えてて！　『アイフェス』に来てくれた\nお客さんに、劇場の宣伝をするために……。", "zh": "不，我想得非常深入！为了向来看\n“爱偶祭”的观众宣传剧场……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1007_p", "source_sha256": "de772e7690b69753a5ab25f73cac2de68082deb8aefeea73df5cd773334719d9", "ja": "アイドル達のインタビュー形式で、宣伝用の動画を\n撮るつもりなんだ。テーマは『私たちの劇場』！", "zh": "我打算采用采访偶像们的形式，拍摄宣传视频。主题是“我们的剧场”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "587cf9d3001d2c2418d4902b84af570cd3b6673214c88959f590717f3bef8137", "ja": "まあ、『私たちの劇場』を、インタビューで……。\nふふっ、みんなの答えが楽しみですね！", "zh": "哎呀，用采访的形式来聊“我们的剧场”啊……\n呵呵，真期待大家的回答呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4419e4998db9b62561c8cce5563703f6de9f85a5a0a0b460e811e6abb4b69558", "ja": "ですよね？　でも俺が忙しすぎて、撮る時間がなくて。\n……そうだ！　ふたりに撮影、お願いしようかな？", "zh": "对吧？可是我实在太忙了，根本没时间拍摄。\n……对了！要不拜托你们两个来拍摄？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "39c04c5ad19ffdb5288d71283a1cb9ca8309f7f9e2a96f2b8468d394468ff7db", "ja": "えっ、私達がインタビュアーを？　そんな大役、\n私にはとても……。そうだわ、紬ちゃんなら！", "zh": "诶？要我们来当采访者？这么重要的任务，我实在……对了，小紬的话就可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d74cc0bac28cf1d0b202773e8b1330d257c339fbbc94b36e68da24d97af94be4", "ja": "ま、待ってください！　いまだにMCで言葉に詰まる\n私が、インタビュアーなんて……百年早いです！", "zh": "等、请等一下！我到现在做MC都还会卡壳，\n让我去当采访员什么的……还早了一百年呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0373ab4ce97a9563eeeef5d8b510964b7d9ae4ca4e19bda9d16874f83a81f6ed", "ja": "そ、そうか？\nそれはもう少し早めに克服しないと……うん？", "zh": "是、是吗？那可得再早点克服才行……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "993b724ad3a0e9e4e20ab002f0d8d0037fc8a42a8fc9dc0a5f177a775fecd1e3", "ja": "ムフフ……♪\n話は聞かせてもらいました！", "zh": "哼哼……♪\n我已经听到你们说的了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9af8fa95727f561ffd06f72a9f71f5e1f11277474b2e09be715a84e36d2e6158", "ja": "この声は、もしか……しなくても亜利沙だな！？", "zh": "这个声音，就算不用猜也知道是亚利沙吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "11a1574adb1b2978fd5e0d82c8fc5c4528444813d97d5797852fe1f3a0830fb4", "ja": "はいっ、通りすがりのありさです。決して物陰で\n聞き耳をたてていた怪しい者じゃありません！", "zh": "是的！我是路过的亚利沙。绝对不是躲在暗处偷听的可疑人士！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "3f54de9d794d1427a37f52e0917e8f8a13a84fbf2828b07f95932f35d9c6cc65", "ja": "{$P$}、私もいます。\n同じく通りすがりの真壁瑞希です。", "zh": "{$P$}，我也在。\n同样是路过的真壁瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "c22546bda3bf8881c24256d58b1f7307415b0e8aaa00f5c34fb074726555ef26", "ja": "というわけで、ありさ、動画を撮るのはそこそこ\n得意なので……お手伝いできると思いますよ♪", "zh": "所以说，亚利沙还算擅长拍视频……应该能帮上忙哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "6b64bf4caebeecd69888bcf04ad0ccf42f95ae7b5b0e6b6497c4b1e7c6776ad2", "ja": "私もトークは苦手ですが、手先は器用な方なので、\n何かお力になれるかと。……むむん。", "zh": "我也不擅长聊天，不过我的手还算灵巧，应该能帮上什么忙。……嗯嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1019_p", "source_sha256": "5d48927e739267bb753141e9504321eaf35228aa11e27ae25ddbd5f34eb46390", "ja": "そうか、ありがたいよ。\nそれじゃ、この4人にお願いしようかな。", "zh": "这样啊，真是帮大忙了。\n那就拜托这4个人吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1020_052kao", "source_sha256": "9b7bcf5b2a805f4c2c77c165141f30f25d2978d7791f8e7310c2c65ea1cf10ac", "ja": "よかった！　4人でなら何とかなりそうね、紬ちゃん♪\nみんなで力を合わせて頑張りましょう♪", "zh": "太好了！有4个人的话总会有办法的呢，紬♪\n大家齐心协力一起加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6227c9fbf09be260a0789231639f53672b7f76cada047c56a8adddd5f29b9bc8", "ja": "そ、そうですか？　桜守さんがそう仰るのでしたら……\nわかりました。とにかく、力は尽くします……！", "zh": "这、这样吗？既然樱守小姐都这么说了……\n\n我明白了。总之，我会竭尽全力的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "2fed9160c485127150be5d9bd9253eae5b73a79c1e03dae7f8643acc05886a3c", "ja": "それでは早速、被写体を探しにいきましょう。\nいざ、堂々と撮影開始です！　……ムフフ♪", "zh": "那么我们马上去找拍摄对象吧。\n现在就堂堂正正地开始拍摄！……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1023_p", "source_sha256": "fcb05e1eda3026200a6c570703393f6821f13e86475256c84aa53a69b6107e8d", "ja": "（……というわけで、たまたまレッスンルームにいた\n可奈と杏奈に、出演をお願いした）", "zh": "（……于是，就拜托碰巧在练习室里的可奈和杏奈出演了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "a38570c547231df0c144843e46518fee110665c686524cf2ca6dce4118e9124d", "ja": "え、えっと……うぅ～！\nきゅ、急すぎて、まだ心の準備が……。", "zh": "呃，呃……呜呜～！\n太、太突然了，我还没做好心理准备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "2ce8ea18de2b1e179a21d4e5e3a263463224b6fa3c0917b7d67460eec8cba98a", "ja": "ふおおぉっ、いただきました！\n焦った可奈ちゃんの表情、カワイイです！　最高です！", "zh": "呜哦哦哦，拍到了！\n慌张的可奈表情，太可爱了！最棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1026_024ann", "source_sha256": "c42069e5f9e5dde67de0311275c40c79729377cc6a54c3191abcb9b78f2efde6", "ja": "亜利沙、ちょっとうるさい……。\n可奈、余計に……緊張しちゃう、から。", "zh": "亚利沙，有点吵……  \n可奈会更加……紧张的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "33682e6ba7922bc0bc13e4de3149e461203ebb0dbd650d963198d57401d6cad4", "ja": "それでは『私たちの劇場』について、\nひと言お願いします。……3、2、1、きゅー。", "zh": "那么，请就《我们的剧场》说几句吧。……3、2、1，开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "e317e2ef3481fb8a65fa1885291b706369d4814d0511f4e4571da9e170996820", "ja": "わわっ、は、はい！　どうもっ、矢吹可奈で～す！\n今日はこの劇場の紹介をしちゃいますね！", "zh": "哇哇，好、好的！大家好～，我是矢吹可奈！\n今天由我来为大家介绍这座剧场哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "5daf14df0a1e572da9df33e48ba7640da78e4490b63a88df00d4ac4a5325fdb2", "ja": "って言っても、どう言ったらいいのかな～？\n学校が終わったら、ここにきて……みんながいて。", "zh": "话虽这么说，可该怎么介绍才好呢～？\n放学后就会来到这里……然后大家都在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "00b30ec5cef7cb9e69a949f1f40ce958012b7bb7a1699de1ed6f3466cb33902c", "ja": "いつも、当たり前にここにあるけど、\nそれがとっても楽しいんだ～♪　ね、杏奈ちゃん？", "zh": "这里总是理所当然地有大家在，但那真的特别开心～♪对吧，杏奈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "d35220c35520d2cc8b44e54d6bf634282feb6eda8003ecf2073843d556232a93", "ja": "うん、杏奈もそう思うっ！\nいつもみんながいるから、賑やかで楽しくて。", "zh": "嗯，杏奈也这么觉得！\n因为大家一直都在这里，所以热热闹闹的，很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1032_024ann", "source_sha256": "b92722e4d904b3e2d17f93046bff32b47072b72bfe9751b0ea8006805d4e37d6", "ja": "みんなでビビッと盛り上がれる、\n大好きで、大切な場所……それが劇場、だよね！", "zh": "能和大家一起嗨翻天、\n最喜欢又最重要的场所……那就是剧场，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "cdf9e677d8136dbde43e7f21099d6484579036c4ab49ef8e07148f1bf767035a", "ja": "うん！　劇場で～みんなと出会った～♪\n君に夢中～、ブランにゅう～♪", "zh": "嗯！在剧场～和大家相遇了～♪\n深深为你着迷～全新～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_077_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "b02624925ae52b5d7b6a6a5c8809f50c889888034b69635d88572f75f90b354f", "ja": "いいですよ～可奈ちゃん！\nはい、杏奈ちゃんもご一緒に！　きゅー！", "zh": "很好哦～可奈！\n来，杏奈也一起！Action～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
